pixman-retro: pixman with an R5900 (PlayStation 2 Emotion Engine) 128-bit MMI
backend, used for MACHINE=playstation2 in place of xsrc's pixman.

dist/ is a git submodule of https://github.com/maekawa-mugi/pixman-retro
(MIT licence).  Clone this tree with --recurse-submodules, or run

	git submodule update --init

before building X11 for playstation2.  Other ports do not use it.

external/mit/xorg/lib/pixman builds from dist/pixman when MACHINE is
playstation2 (X11SRCDIR.pixman in share/mk/bsd.own.mk); headers and
pixman-1.pc still come from xsrc's external/mit/pixman/include.
To update, check out a newer commit in dist/ and commit the submodule.
